  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be two functions satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "512",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;{Even function}</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>|</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>512</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>512</mn></math></p>"
  }
